{"seq":3,"slug":"paxos-variants","title":"Paxos 变体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consensus-algorithms-raft-paxos/paxos/paxos-variants","wordCount":1563,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"paxos-变体\">Paxos 变体</h1><p>经典 Multi-Paxos 有两处一直被人惦记的「税」：每条命令至少一轮往返、所有写都得过单个领导者这道窄门。三十多年里，学术界和工业界围着这两点改出了一大家子变体——有的砍延迟，有的拆 quorum 约束，有的干脆不要领导者。它们大多没成为 etcd 那样的主流产品，却清晰地勾出了 Paxos 家族的设计空间，也解释了为什么主流最终选了 Raft 这种「朴素但好实现」的路线。2025 年还有新论文(EPaxos*)在修补这个家族里最复杂成员的正确性 bug，可见这片地至今未冷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把主要变体按「它优化了 Multi-Paxos 的哪个痛点」摆开，全景就清楚了。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  MP[&quot;Multi-Paxos 的两处税&quot;] --&gt; T1[&quot;税1: 每命令至少一轮往返&quot;]&#10;  MP --&gt; T2[&quot;税2: 所有写过单领导者&quot;]&#10;  T1 --&gt; FAST[&quot;Fast Paxos&lt;br/&gt;无冲突时省一轮&lt;br/&gt;代价: 更大quorum+冲突回退&quot;]&#10;  T2 --&gt; FLEX[&quot;Flexible Paxos&lt;br/&gt;拆开两阶段quorum约束&lt;br/&gt;只需Q1与Q2相交&quot;]&#10;  T2 --&gt; EP[&quot;EPaxos 无领导者&lt;br/&gt;任意副本可协调&lt;br/&gt;用命令依赖图定序&quot;]&#10;  T2 --&gt; WP[&quot;WPaxos / Mencius&lt;br/&gt;分区/轮转所有权&lt;br/&gt;面向跨地域&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  MP[\"Multi-Paxos 的两处税\"] --&gt; T1[\"税1: 每命令至少一轮往返\"]\n  MP --&gt; T2[\"税2: 所有写过单领导者\"]\n  T1 --&gt; FAST[\"Fast Paxos&lt;br/&gt;无冲突时省一轮&lt;br/&gt;代价: 更大quorum+冲突回退\"]\n  T2 --&gt; FLEX[\"Flexible Paxos&lt;br/&gt;拆开两阶段quorum约束&lt;br/&gt;只需Q1与Q2相交\"]\n  T2 --&gt; EP[\"EPaxos 无领导者&lt;br/&gt;任意副本可协调&lt;br/&gt;用命令依赖图定序\"]\n  T2 --&gt; WP[\"WPaxos / Mencius&lt;br/&gt;分区/轮转所有权&lt;br/&gt;面向跨地域\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变体</th>\n<th>优化目标</th>\n<th>核心手段</th>\n<th>落地情况</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Fast Paxos</td>\n<td>降单命令延迟</td>\n<td>客户端直发接受者，省一轮</td>\n<td>学术为主，冲突回退复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Flexible Paxos</td>\n<td>放松 quorum</td>\n<td>仅要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_1 \\cap Q_2 \\neq \\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6633em;vertical-align:-0.0817em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>影响了多个生产系统的 quorum 设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EPaxos</td>\n<td>去单点瓶颈</td>\n<td>无领导者 + 命令依赖图</td>\n<td>研究级，2025 仍在修正确性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mencius/WPaxos</td>\n<td>跨地域均衡</td>\n<td>轮转/分区领导权</td>\n<td>面向 WAN 的研究与原型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"fast-paxos-用更大的多数派换一轮延迟\">Fast Paxos：用更大的多数派换一轮延迟</h2><p>经典 Paxos 里客户端要先把命令发给领导者，领导者再 Accept 给接受者——这是两跳。Fast Paxos 的想法是让客户端在「快速轮」里直接把命令发给接受者，省掉经过领导者的那一跳，无冲突时延迟更低。代价有两个：一是快速轮需要更大的 quorum 才能保证安全(经典是过半，快速轮要约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil 3n/4 \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/4</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span> 量级)，因为没有领导者居中协调、要靠更大交集来仲裁；二是当多个客户端并发直发、对同一实例提了不同命令时会发生冲突，必须回退到一个经典轮由领导者收拾残局。</p>\n<p>Fast Paxos 揭示了一个普遍权衡：想省往返，往往要付出更大 quorum 或更复杂的冲突恢复。这个权衡在后面的 BFT 协议里也会以另一种形式出现。Fast Paxos 本身因为冲突恢复逻辑繁琐、收益在高竞争下被吃光，没能大规模落地，但「客户端绕过领导者直发」的思路深刻影响了后来的无领导者设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"flexible-paxos-拆开被绑死的-quorum\">Flexible Paxos：拆开被绑死的 quorum</h2><p>经典 Paxos 默认阶段一和阶段二都用「过半」的 quorum，但 2016 年 Flexible Paxos(FPaxos)指出这其实约束过紧。真正的安全性只要求一件事：阶段一的 quorum(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>)与阶段二的 quorum(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>)必须相交。即:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|Q_1| + |Q_2| &gt; n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 各自不必都过半！这给了系统设计者一个新旋钮。比如在一个 5 节点系统里，可以让阶段二(每条命令都走、是热路径)的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 只需 2 个节点，而把阶段一(只在选主时走、是冷路径)的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 设为 4 个节点——只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2+4&gt;5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 满足相交即可。结果是：日常写入的延迟和容错门槛由更小的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定，性能更好；代价是选主时要联系更多节点。这种「热路径用小 quorum、冷路径用大 quorum」的思想很实用，影响了不少生产系统对读写 quorum 的非对称配置。它本质上是把 <a href=\"../foundations/consensus-problem\">共识问题</a> 里的多数派相交性质用到极致——相交才是充分条件，过半只是它的一个特例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"epaxos-无领导者与命令依赖图\">EPaxos：无领导者与命令依赖图</h2><p>EPaxos(Egalitarian Paxos)走得最激进：彻底取消固定领导者，任何副本都能作为某条命令的协调者。这直接解决了单领导者的两个痛点——领导者既是性能瓶颈又是跨地域延迟的根源(远端客户端必须绕到领导者所在机房)。在 EPaxos 里，离客户端最近的副本就能协调它的命令，跨地域延迟显著降低。</p>\n<p>代价是定序变难。没有领导者这个天然的全序裁判，EPaxos 改用「命令依赖关系」来定序：如果两条命令不冲突(比如操作不同的键，可交换)，就允许它们乱序、并行提交；只有相互冲突的命令才需要确定先后。系统因此维护一张命令依赖图，提交时在图上做拓扑排序得到执行顺序。无冲突命令只需一轮即可提交(快速路径)，这是 EPaxos 的吸引力所在。但代价沉重：依赖图的管理、冲突命令的恢复协议异常复杂，原始论文的规范长期被发现有歧义和正确性 bug。直到 2025 年底，仍有研究(Ryabinin 等人在 OPODIS 2025 提出的 EPaxos*)在简化并修正它的故障恢复算法、补全严格的正确性证明。这正是主流工程界宁选 <a href=\"../raft/raft-leader-election\">Raft 领导选举</a> 那种「单领导者、易理解、易实现」路线的现实注脚——理论上更优的协议，若没人能正确实现，就只是论文里的优。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Paxos 变体围绕 Multi-Paxos 的两处税(每命令一往返、单领导者瓶颈)展开，勾出整个家族的设计空间。</li>\n<li>Fast Paxos 让客户端直发接受者省一轮，代价是更大 quorum 与并发冲突回退，揭示「省往返要付更大 quorum」的普遍权衡。</li>\n<li>Flexible Paxos 指出安全只需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_1 \\cap Q_2 \\neq \\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6633em;vertical-align:-0.0817em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不必都过半，催生「热路径小 quorum、冷路径大 quorum」的非对称配置。</li>\n<li>EPaxos 无领导者、用命令依赖图定序，跨地域延迟低，但恢复协议极复杂、长期有正确性 bug，2025 年仍在被修正(EPaxos*)。</li>\n<li>这些变体的「叫好不叫座」恰恰解释了主流为何选 Raft：可正确实现，往往胜过理论上的最优。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"multi-paxos\">Multi-Paxos</a> — 变体们试图优化的基准协议。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../practice/consensus-tradeoffs\">取舍与选型</a> — 何时值得为变体的性能收益承担其复杂度。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../distributed-coordination-services/foundations/consistency-guarantees\">一致性保证</a> — 非对称 quorum 如何影响协调服务的一致性级别。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Paxos 变体","id":"paxos-变体"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Fast Paxos：用更大的多数派换一轮延迟","id":"fast-paxos-用更大的多数派换一轮延迟"},{"level":2,"text":"Flexible Paxos：拆开被绑死的 quorum","id":"flexible-paxos-拆开被绑死的-quorum"},{"level":2,"text":"EPaxos：无领导者与命令依赖图","id":"epaxos-无领导者与命令依赖图"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Multi-Paxos 多实例共识","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consensus-algorithms-raft-paxos/paxos/multi-paxos"},"next":{"title":"Raft 领导选举","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consensus-algorithms-raft-paxos/raft/raft-leader-election"}}